# `fastapi deploy` walks the upload with rignore, which honours .gitignore —
# this repository's and the root one. The exported web build in static/ is
# ignored by git on purpose (generated, never committed), and its own asset
# tree contains directories the root .gitignore excludes as well, notably
# `assets/node_modules/`. Whitelists here take precedence over .gitignore, so
# both lines are needed: without them the deployment silently ships the API
# with a missing or incomplete frontend.
!static/
!static/**
